        "\\varphi_{ab} = \\arg \\left[ e^{i\\delta t} \\left( \\cos\\Omega' t - i \\frac{\\delta}{\\Omega'} \\sin\\Omega' t \\right) \\right] , \\tag{7.86}\n",
